    subtopic: 'Size of a Business',
    summary_60s: 'Measurement of Business Size and Business Growth Meaning of Business Size Business size refers to the scale at which a business operates. It indicates the capacity, level of operations, and resources controlled by a business enterprise . Businesses may be classified into differen',
